OL,3,GNEWSATrain disruption after signalling
OL,4,Afault
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo train services were able to pass
OL,7,Fthrough Birmingham Moor Street railway
OL,8,Fstation on Thursday morning due to a
OL,9,Ffault with the station's signalling
OL,10,Fsystem.
OL,12,FWest Midlands Railway said that
OL,13,Fservices between Birmingham Snow Hill
OL,14,Fand Dorridge, Whitlocks End, and
OL,15,FStratford-upon-Avon in both directions
OL,16,Fwere subject to delays, cancellation
OL,17,Fand alteration.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
