OL,3,GNEWSATrain disruption after signalling
OL,4,Afault
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to National Rail, all lines
OL,7,Fhave since re-opened, but disruption is
OL,8,Fexpected until 13:00 GMT and trains
OL,9,Fcould face delays of up to 40 minutes
OL,10,Fif not cancelled.
OL,12,FWest Midlands Railway said "services
OL,13,Fare on the move now, however we are
OL,14,Fcontinuing to experience severe delays
OL,15,Facross the Snow Hill lines."
